<title>BOTSWANA: Botswana yr/yr inflation holds steady at 9.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Botswana yr/yr inflation holds steady at 9.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Botswana's all items consumer price index rose 0.5 per cent in November from October, holding the year-on-year rate of inflation at 9.8 per cent, the Central Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				Nov 1966	 Oct 1966	Nov 1995</p>
<p>    Yr/Yr pct change    9.8		9.8	     10.4</p>
<p>    All-items index     175.7	    174.8	   160.0</p>
<p>Note - Index November 1991 = 100</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
